      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a sense of existential nihilism, feeling that life has lost its inherent meaning and purpose. You've reached a point where the tasks and roles that drove your existence are no longer relevant, leaving you feeling empty and without direction. This can be a profoundly unsettling experience, especially if you've defined your identity around your contributions and accomplishments. It's as if you're questioning the very fabric of your existence.",
